    "updated_at": "2023-01-30T13:10:54Z",
    "body": "The size of the icon / symbol, is based on the font used by the terminal. AFAIK, there is no way that _Starship_ has influence about the font size.\r\n\r\nI would recommend to either use a different symbol or a different font.",
